<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 114 0 R/T(G\312NESIS 34:13-17: \215RESPONDERAM COM ENGANO\216)/E(G\312NESIS 34:13-17: \215RESPONDERAM COM ENGANO\216)/Pg 42 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

